OL,3,GNEWSATurner Prize workshops hope to
OL,4,Ainspire youngsters
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool children have been taking part
OL,7,Fin workshops inspired by this year's
OL,8,FTurner Prize nominated artworks.
OL,10,FTeesside University's Middlesbrough
OL,11,FInstitute of Modern Art (MIMA) is
OL,12,Fhosting work by four artists in the
OL,13,Frunning for the prestigious award -
OL,14,FSimeon Barclay, Kira Freije, Marguerite
OL,15,FHumeau and Tanoa Sasraku.
OL,17,FAround 17,000 youngsters across the
OL,18,FTees Valley have been signed up to the
OL,19,FTurner on Tees schools programme which
OL,20,Finvolves artist-led workshops.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
