OL,3,GNEWSATurner Prize workshops hope to
OL,4,Ainspire youngsters
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior learning curator at MIMA, Claire
OL,7,FPounder, said they hoped to inspire
OL,8,F"cultural confidence and capital" and
OL,9,Fget young people visiting galleries.
